{"recordId":"general_王保保_908147860","name":"王保保","type":"general","dynasty":"元朝","title":"擴廓帖木兒","canonicalName":null,"aliases":[],"identityStatus":"candidate","candidatePages":[{"title":"擴廓帖木兒","pageId":95690,"revisionId":94335147,"revisionTimestamp":"2026-09-13T09:56:37Z","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%93%B4%E5%BB%93%E5%B8%96%E6%9C%A8%E5%85%92","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94335147","wikidataId":"Q489922","isDisambiguation":false,"bibliography":[{"citationTitle":"《元代赛因赤答忽墓志考》","url":"https://d.wanfangdata.com.cn/periodical/ChlQZXJpb2RpY2FsQ0hJTmV3UzIwMjExMDI2Eg13d3NqMjAwNDA0MDA0Ggh6amF0cGhodQ%3D%3D","type":"citation-template","template":"Cite journal","author":"罗火金","publisher":"山西省文物局","date":"2004","isbn":"","locator":"citation template"},{"citationTitle":"明史·王保保传","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"明史·卷一百二十四·列传第十二","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"新元史·卷二百二十·列传第一百十六","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"元代赛因赤答忽墓志考","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"明史","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"明实录·太祖高皇帝實錄","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"元史","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"扩廓帖木儿传","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"新元史","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"《元史》卷一百四十一《扩廓帖木儿传》","url":"http://www.guoxue.com/shibu/24shi/yuanshi/yuas_141.htm","type":"reference-link","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"《新元史》卷二百二十《扩廓帖木儿传》","url":"http://www.guoxue123.com/shibu/0101/00xys/219.htm","type":"reference-link","locator":"reference or bibliography section"}],"wikisourceLinks":[{"title":"明史/卷124","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%98%8E%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B7124","origin":"literal-wikitext-link","retrieved":false}],"retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:33:15.373Z","attribution":{"source":"Chinese Wikipedia contributors","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0; bibliography metadata only","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","status":"candidate index, not independently verified evidence"}}],"sourceIds":["source:mingshi","source:qingshigao"],"reviewIds":[],"claimIds":[],"matches":[{"documentId":"document:mingshi-5135c897aae5a094","query":"王保保","count":1,"offset":2175,"excerpt":"子妃。\n\n　　初，太祖冊常妃，繼冊呂妃。常氏薨，呂氏始獨居東宮。而其時秦王樉亦納王保保妹為妃，又以鄧愈女為配，皆前代故事所無也。\n\n睿宗興獻皇帝\n\n　　睿宗興獻皇帝祐杬，憲宗第四子。母邵貴妃。成化二十三年封興王。弘治四年建邸德安。已，改安陸。七年","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:mingshi-979c5e3da55bd050","query":"王保保","count":1,"offset":1459,"excerpt":"於秦，期永綏祿位，以籓屏帝室。夫何不良於德，竟殞厥身，其謚曰愍。」樉妃，元河南王王保保女弟。次妃，寧河王鄧愈女。樉薨，王妃殉。\n\n子隱王尚炳嗣。沔人高福興等為亂，尚炳巡邊境上捕盜。永樂九年，使者至西安，尚炳稱疾不出迎，見使者又傲慢。帝逮治王府官吏","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:mingshi-fe26b4249e1dd1a2","query":"王保保","count":2,"offset":8609,"excerpt":"祖遣都事孫養浩報聘，遺玉珍書曰：「足下處西蜀，予處江左，蓋與漢季孫、劉相類。近者王保保以鐵騎勁兵，虎踞中原，其志殆不在曹操下，使有謀臣如攸、彧，猛將如遼、郃，予兩人能高枕無憂乎。予與足下實脣齒邦，願以孫劉相吞噬為鑒。」自後信使往返不絕。\n\n　　二","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:mingshi-cdfe7003b2a0d050","query":"王保保","count":1,"offset":2228,"excerpt":"春將不過萬人，橫行無敵，真奇男子。」太祖笑曰：「遇春雖人傑，吾得而臣之。吾不能臣王保保，其人奇男子也。」竟冊其妹為秦王妃。\n\n　　張昶仕明，累官中書省參知政事，有才辨，明習故事，裁決如流，甚見信任。自以故元臣，心嘗戀戀。會太祖縱降人北還，昶附私書","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:mingshi-9ed8e64e16c82385","query":"王保保","count":1,"offset":2016,"excerpt":"捷聞，太祖幸汴梁，召達詣行在所，置酒勞之，且謀北伐。達曰：「大軍平齊魯，掃河洛，王保保逡巡觀望；潼關既克，思齊輩狼狽西奔。元聲援已絕，今乘勢直搗元都，可不戰有也。」帝曰：「善。」達復進曰：「元都克，而其主北走，將窮追之乎？」帝曰：「元運衰矣，行自","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:mingshi-da3298c46f044a8b","query":"王保保","count":1,"offset":1759,"excerpt":"喪，遂請告歸。時帝方營中都，又銳意滅擴廓。基瀕行，奏曰：「鳳陽雖帝鄉，非建都地。王保保未可輕也。」已而定西失利，擴廓竟走沙漠，迄為邊患。其冬，帝手詔敘基勳伐，召赴京，賜賚甚厚，追贈基祖、父皆永嘉郡公。累欲進基爵，基固辭不受。\n\n　　初，太祖以事責","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:mingshi-d5b14c4f45f87385","query":"王保保","count":5,"offset":161,"excerpt":"太祖實錄卷四二洪武二年六月己卯條都作「慶生」。〕平章鼎住。\n\n時元主奔應昌，其將王保保據定西為邊患。三年春，以徐達為大將軍，使出西安擣定西；李文忠為左副將軍，馮勝為右副將軍，使出居庸擣應昌。文忠至興和，擒平章竹貞，復大破元兵於駱駝山，遂趨應昌。未","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:qingshigao-a36b6e1637731812","query":"王保保","count":1,"offset":324,"excerpt":"等處行中書省，統和林總管府。皇慶元年，改和林路為和寧路。順帝太子阿裕錫哩達賴汗依王保保於此，明兵破之，順帝孫特古斯特穆爾汗遁於土喇河。七傳至本雅失里，又為明所敗。後諸部共立託克託布哈之子號小王子。又數傳，徙幕東方，其留漠北部落曰喀爾喀。清崇德三年","matchType":"name-occurrence"}],"matchCount":8,"gaps":["身份連結尚未完成編輯核對；同名、異名或同時代關係可能有誤配。","原人物分析及能力數值尚未逐句核對。","來源中的年代、關係與評價仍需逐條轉成有出處的主張。"],"notes":["姓名／重新導向命中，人物身份與每條書目尚須逐項核對。","姓名、分類、時代及稱號保留原庫資料，不自動視為史實。"],"version":"b66c5a60a41e2334","matchedDocuments":[{"id":"document:mingshi-5135c897aae5a094","bookId":"book:mingshi","requestedTitle":"明史/卷115","title":"明史/卷115","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%98%8E%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B7115","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2594732","historyUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%98%8E%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B7115?action=history","revisionId":2594732,"revisionTimestamp":"2025-08-30T13:37:12Z","retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:59:07.285Z","sha256":"5e0bc9e3655e6ff335de117761e7cfd379d08054872d42a4ed861d9b1afa9487","textSha256":"1fec9509be34ca5d0d152b539abcdb72d5f6f4893ef41ccbe30e8b0a2eca54d5","expandedWikitextSha256":"5e0bc9e3655e6ff335de117761e7cfd379d08054872d42a4ed861d9b1afa9487","characters":4148,"contentPath":"/static/data/history/archive-books/mingshi.json","status":"downloaded","acquisitionStatus":"downloaded","reuse":"Ancient underlying text; Wikisource transcription attribution and CC BY-SA 4.0 for applicable contributions","extraction":"wikitext-conservative-v2.1.0","normalizedAt":"2026-10-02T11:14:45.272Z","upstreamTextQuality":null,"upstreamTextQualityMea